      "filename": "Paper graffito Banganarti.jpg",
      "title": "File:Paper graffito Banganarti.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/02/Paper_graffito_Banganarti.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
